---
import Sheet from '../../layouts/Sheet.astro';
import BusRule from '../../components/BusRule.astro';
import ElementTile from '../../components/ElementTile.astro';
---

<Sheet sheet="04" description="Cuniculus is Skylar Coelho's power systems engineering studio.">
  <header class="head">
    <p class="label">04 · about</p>
    <h1>Cuniculus is the studio of Skylar Coelho.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Bio and how to engage are in preparation.</p>
  </header>

  <BusRule />

  <section class="story" aria-labelledby="name">
    <h2 id="name">The name</h2>
    <div class="story__body">
      <p>
        <em>Cuniculus</em> (koo-NIK-yoo-lus) is Latin for rabbit, and <em>coelho</em> is Portuguese for the same animal.
        It also means an underground channel: Roman and Etruscan <em>cuniculi</em> were drainage and water tunnels,
        ancient infrastructure engineering.
      </p>
      <p>
        It shortens to Cu, copper, the conductor of the grid. The first project, Stannum, is Sn, tin.
        Copper and tin make bronze, so the studio and its first project form an alloy.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="alloy" role="group" aria-label="Copper plus tin makes bronze">
      <ElementTile symbol="Cu" name="Cuniculus" number={29} mass="63.546" mark />
      <span class="op" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
      <ElementTile symbol="Sn" name="Stannum" number={50} mass="118.71" />
      <span class="op" aria-hidden="true">=</span>
      <ElementTile symbol="CuSn" name="Bronze" number="alloy" mass="88/12" label="Bronze, the alloy, 88 parts copper to 12 tin" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Sheet>

<style>
  .head { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .head .label { margin: 0; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); max-width: 40rem; }
  .lede { margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .story {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: 1.5rem;
    row-gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }
  h2 { grid-column: span 4; font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .story__body { grid-column: 5 / span 7; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 38rem; }
  .story__body em { color: var(--paper); font-style: italic; }
  .alloy { grid-column: 5 / span 8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; }
  .op { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--label); }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    h2, .story__body, .alloy { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .alloy { gap: 0.5rem; }
  }
</style>
